{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：07:56 2026-09-10 HKT<br/>發佈時間：06:32 2026-09-10 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：06:32 2026-09-10 HKT</p><p>啟德有女嬰猝死。今日（10日）凌晨5時31分，警方接獲一名女子報案，指其一歲女兒在啟德世運道20號簡約公屋6座一單位內昏迷不醒。</p><p>救援人員接報到場後，發現女嬰無呼吸及無脈搏，隨即將她送往廣華醫院搶救，惜終告不治。警方正調查事件。</p><img alt=\"女嬰家人在醫院了解事件。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c2104784a1e8889a7a040ac15593c142/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_00_19_54.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"一名1歲大女嬰在世運道20號簡約公屋6座一單位昏迷，送院死亡。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/ad74cc07aa59b503934f67e236ddb8f0/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_23_44_30.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/483871b527f5eb71b2dd9f47265945ac/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_06_44_31.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是啟德世運道20號簡約公屋6座一單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b2df4c552b3fc8ab712bfeceb8073650/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_23_44_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"1歲大女嬰在啟德簡約公屋6座單位昏迷，獲送院搶救不治。黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/87499dd083f3b7f17ea3ff0a6b157213/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-09_at_23_44_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員正調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/91e32b1b875d75cf4f2073f060f522a1/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_00_03_29.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"女嬰被送往廣華醫院，警員正調查事件。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/8669a459e87596a5505ba602d77e6486/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_00_03_28.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/cfd9b412ed20536a1f1f1e84dee43c85/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-10_at_07_06_55.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T00:51:25.527595+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}